WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,830
Husband

2
00:00:00,880 --> 00:00:02,600
Who the hell made you angry again?

3
00:00:03,040 --> 00:00:04,680
Aren't they just those ignorant civil and military officials?

4
00:00:04,680 --> 00:00:05,840
A certain family is obviously the Minister of the Ministry of War

5
00:00:05,840 --> 00:00:06,840
Great civil servant of justice

6
00:00:06,840 --> 00:00:08,480
What did they praise a certain family behind their back?

7
00:00:08,480 --> 00:00:09,560
The hands of four powerful generals

8
00:00:09,560 --> 00:00:10,560
The king is even more dizzy

9
00:00:10,560 --> 00:00:11,840
Send eunuchs to force me to take charge

10
00:00:11,840 --> 00:00:15,120
If you are mad at a certain family, please calm down and gossip about others.

11
00:00:15,120 --> 00:00:16,320
Just go from the base of their toes and tongues

12
00:00:16,320 --> 00:00:17,400
Why bother sharing their anger?

13
00:00:17,960 --> 00:00:19,080
Someone has thought of a way

14
00:00:19,080 --> 00:00:20,680
Look, what clever idea does your husband have?

15
00:00:20,680 --> 00:00:22,240
They insist on recruiting a certain family to take charge to make up the number.

16
00:00:22,240 --> 00:00:23,760
It’s all because three of these four great generals are missing.

17
00:00:23,840 --> 00:00:25,480
As long as a certain family recruits another fierce party member,

18
00:00:25,480 --> 00:00:26,600
Four powerful chess games

19
00:00:26,600 --> 00:00:28,480
If not, there would be no excuse to force a certain family to lead a charge.

20
00:00:29,960 --> 00:00:31,600
Husband, listen to this idea

21
00:00:31,600 --> 00:00:33,200
It actually makes some sense

22
00:00:33,200 --> 00:00:34,920
Madam, please rest well in your house.

23
00:00:34,920 --> 00:00:36,400
A certain family will go back to their hometown immediately

24
00:00:36,400 --> 00:00:38,280
Digging up a fierce general and blocking their mouths

25
00:00:38,680 --> 00:00:40,080
The lonely big fish is the strongest general

26
00:00:40,080 --> 00:00:43,160
I smashed all the handsome men and left them alone. What do you mean by attacking today?

27
00:00:43,160 --> 00:00:45,160
Your Majesty, please don’t spend your time being a minister. I am the Minister of the Ministry of War.

28
00:00:45,160 --> 00:00:47,520
He is a weak man with no power to strike, and he will never take command.

29
00:00:47,520 --> 00:00:49,040
A divine power capable of uprooting the mountains and silk city

30
00:00:49,040 --> 00:00:50,560
I just have the heart to be a bitch.

31
00:00:50,560 --> 00:00:51,560
Okay, Mr. Li

32
00:00:51,560 --> 00:00:53,200
Then why are you afraid of attacking in a foreign land today?
